// s5-policy/vsl-language/execution_reframe.vsm — reframe() only, from §8.
// Source: vsl_language §8 execution semantics (Part IV.b). Item of the
// reference set. tick(L) ≡ primer.tick — declared in
// core_boot_primer.vsm, NOT re-stated here.

execution_reframe("VSL-LANG-EXECUTION-REF") {

  reframe: "
    reframe(V_id, new_parent_id) — double-loop, human gate required (D4):
      propose:  S4 detects meta_shift ∨ external_governance → φ↑(HIGH)
      validate: governed(new_parent) ∧ credential_ok ∧ B(new_parent)≥B(V)
                ∧ A5_corollary_ok
      simulate: Δsignals + Δbudget + Δceiling → impact_report → S5(human)
      commit:   human_approved → V.parent=new_parent | establish φ↑↓
                | files not renamed",
}
⟦ /execution_reframe ⟧